@base = http://localhost:3000

### ============ LOGIN (kirim ketiganya dulu) ============

### Login Budi
# @name loginBudi
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "budi", "password": "Budi#12345" }

###
@tokenBudi = {{loginBudi.response.body.data.token}}

### Login Siti
# @name loginSiti
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "siti", "password": "Siti#12345" }

###
@tokenSiti = {{loginSiti.response.body.data.token}}

### Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin#12345" }

###
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### ============ 12 SKENARIO WAJIB ============

### 1. Login kredensial benar -> 200 (pakai request "Login Budi" di atas)

### 2. Login password salah -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "budi", "password": "salah" }

### 3. Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan

### 4. Token tidak valid -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 5. Mahasiswa buat pengaduan valid -> 201
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Proyektor rusak", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "Proyektor di ruang A-101 tidak menyala." }

### 6. Mahasiswa baca pengaduan sendiri (id 1 milik budi) -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### 7. Mahasiswa baca pengaduan orang lain (id 3 milik siti) -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### 8. Mahasiswa ubah status -> 403
PATCH {{base}}/api/pengaduan/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "selesai" }

### 9. Admin lihat seluruh pengaduan -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 10. Admin perbarui status -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/api/pengaduan/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "diproses" }

### 11. Field wajib kosong -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "", "kategori": "TI" }

### 12. ID tidak ditemukan -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### ============ SKENARIO TAMBAHAN ============

### T1. Client menyisipkan id/mahasiswaId/status -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Proyektor rusak", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "Proyektor di ruang A-101 tidak menyala.", "mahasiswaId": "2024002", "status": "selesai" }

### T2. Admin membuat pengaduan -> 403
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Proyektor rusak", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "Proyektor di ruang A-101 tidak menyala." }

### T3. Siti mengubah pengaduan milik Budi (id 2) -> 403
PUT {{base}}/api/pengaduan/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSiti}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Judul diubah Siti", "kategori": "TI", "deskripsi": "Percobaan mengubah milik orang lain." }

### T4. Budi mengubah pengaduan id 1 yang sudah diproses -> 403
PUT {{base}}/api/pengaduan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Judul diubah Budi", "kategori": "TI", "deskripsi": "Percobaan mengubah setelah diproses." }

### T5. Admin kirim status yang tidak dikenal -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/api/pengaduan/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ngawur" }

### T6. ID bukan angka -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### T7. Budi mengubah pengaduan miliknya (id 2, status diajukan) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/api/pengaduan/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Wi-Fi kampus sangat lambat", "kategori": "TI", "deskripsi": "Koneksi Wi-Fi di perpustakaan sering terputus." }

### T8. Budi menghapus pengaduan miliknya (id 2) -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/api/pengaduan/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}